    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The instant Criminal Misc. Petition under Section 482 of Cr.P.C. has been filed\non behalf of the petitioner for quashing of the Fir No.188/2022 registered at Police Station Tibbi,\nDistrict Hanumangarh for offence punishable under Sections 420 & 406 of Ipc.",
