      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Learned State Counsel has submitted a factual report dated 30.03.2026 received from SHO, Police Station Tibbi, District Hanumangarh, wherein it has been mentioned that after thorough investigation, the Police has submitted a negative final report in this matter on 21.11.2024, before the concerned Court.",
